data: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"type\":\"perps_market\",\"as_of\":\"2026-10-28T23:00:00Z\",\"confidence\":\"reported\",\"source\":{\"name\":\"OptimistFi perps data layer — each venue's public market data, read hourly\",\"url\":\"https://optimistfi.com/perps/funding\",\"license\":\"computed\"},\"data\":{\"view\":\"funding\",\"asOf\":\"2026-10-28T23:00:00Z\",\"notRanked\":{\"openInterestNotPublished\":12,\"volumeNotPublished\":21,\"fundingNotPublished\":26},\"definitions\":{\"openInterest\":\"Open interest is one side of the market: every open contract has a long and a short holder, so it shows how much is open, not which way traders lean. On pool venues (GMX, gTrade, Jupiter, Ostium, Variational, Vest, Veranta) it is traders' longs plus shorts, each facing the pool.\",\"openInterestChange\":\"A change in USD open interest includes the price move; quantityChange values each market at its starting price. On these rows two cohorts sit side by side. openInterestChange1h, openInterestChange4h and openInterestChange24h count a market listed inside the window in whole, as open interest that was not there before, and leave out a market read then and gone now. openInterestChangeSameMarkets and openInterestQuantityChange, over the same windows, cover only the markets read at both ends. The two USD changes differ by the listings' open interest, openInterestAddedByNewListingsUsd, which is absent for a window with no listing or no same-markets change.\",\"depth\":\"Open interest is position notional outstanding, not resting order-book depth.\",\"openInterestSides\":\"On a pool venue (GMX, gTrade, Jupiter, Ostium, Variational, Vest, Veranta), openInterestLongUsd is the dollars of traders' open longs and openInterestShortUsd of their open shorts; they add up to the market's open interest, and the pool holds the other side of each. openInterestLineage gives each venue's formula and whether its dollars are the venue's own (reported) or worked out from its figures (derived). longShare is the longs' part of the two. An order-book venue has no such split: each open long there faces an open short.\",\"quantityBasis\":\"The windows whose openInterestQuantityChange is a price-adjusted proxy: a market in the change publishes no open interest in coins or contracts at both ends, so it is the USD change with the markets' price move taken out, derived and not a direct contract count. Every other window's is in base units, each market valued at its starting price.\",\"notRanked\":\"Markets left out of these rankings because no venue publishes the figure they rank on, counted by the figure missing; a missing figure is not a zero. fundingNotPublished: markets with open interest where no venue holding it publishes a funding rate, so there is no funding weighted by open interest.\",\"availability\":\"A row's figure that is not plainly reported: not_published where no venue listing the market publishes it (the figure is absent), reported_zero for a reported 0. openInterestNotPublished and volume24hNotPublished name the venues a total leaves out.\",\"fundingStates\":\"The venues in fundingRateAnnualized, counted by the rate each gives: settled is the venue's last settlement, current_indicative its running estimate for the period in progress, continuous_accrual a rate accruing with no settlement, not_stated a venue that does not say which.\"},\"highest\":[{\"base\":\"AXON\",\"assetClass\":\"equity\",\"venues\":4,\"price\":422.71,\"fundingObservedAt\":\"2026-10-28T23:00:00Z\",\"priceChange24h\":-0.01194,\"openInterestUsd\":1356126,\"openInterestChange4h\":0.006928,\"openInterestChange24h\":-0.0353,\"openInterestChangeSameMarkets4h\":0.006928,\"openInterestChangeSameMarkets24h\":-0.0353,\"openInterestQuantityChange4h\":0.00897,\"openInterestQuantityChange24h\":-0.02391,\"quantityBasis\":{\"4h\":\"price_adjusted_notional_oi_proxy\",\"24h\":\"price_adjusted_notional_oi_proxy\"},\"volume24hUsd\":235506,\"fundingRateAnnualized\":5.43,\"fundingStates\":{\"current_indicative\":3},\"volume24hNotPublished\":[\"veranta\"],\"page\":\"https://optimistfi.com/perps/markets/axon\"},{\"base\":\"RGTI\",\"assetClass\":\"equity\",\"venues\":6,\"price\":12.399,\"fundingObservedAt\":\"2026-10-28T23:00:00Z\",\"priceChange24h\":-0.003616,\"openInterestUsd\":6836916,\"openInterestChange4h\":0.0212,\"openInterestChange24h\":-0.04465,\"openInterestChangeSameMarkets4h\":0.0212,\"openInterestChangeSameMarkets24h\":-0.04465,\"openInterestQuantityChange4h\":0.001122,\"openInterestQuantityChange24h\":-0.04116,\"volume24hUsd\":722106,\"fundingRateAnnualized\":2.9,\"fundingStates\":{\"current_indicative\":4},\"openInterestNotPublished\":[\"vestmarkets\"],\"volume24hNotPublished\":[\"vest\"],\"page\":\"https://optimistfi.com/perps/markets/rgti\"},{\"base\":\"ATOM\",\"assetClass\":\"crypto\",\"venues\":23,\"price\":1.642,\"fundingObservedAt\":\"2026-10-28T23:00:00Z\",\"priceChange24h\":0.01546,\"openInterestUsd\":42421414,\"openInterestChange4h\":-0.01598,\"openInterestChange24h\":-0.01721,\"openInterestChangeSameMarkets4h\":-0.01598,\"openInterestChangeSameMarkets24h\":-0.01721,\"openInterestQuantityChange4h\":-0.02292,\"openInterestQuantityChange24h\":-0.03202,\"quantityBasis\":{\"4h\":\"price_adjusted_notional_oi_proxy\",\"24h\":\"price_adjusted_notional_oi_proxy\"},\"volume24hUsd\":33315040,\"fundingRateAnnualized\":2.76,\"fundingStates\":{\"continuous_accrual\":2,\"current_indicative\":14,\"not_stated\":4,\"settled\":3},\"volume24hNotPublished\":[\"gains\"],\"page\":\"https://optimistfi.com/perps/markets/atom\"},{\"base\":\"NIO\",\"assetClass\":\"equity\",\"venues\":2,\"price\":3.312,\"fundingObservedAt\":\"2026-10-28T23:00:00Z\",\"priceChange24h\":0.003941,\"openInterestUsd\":1377886,\"openInterestChange4h\":0.007446,\"openInterestChange24h\":-0.02325,\"openInterestChangeSameMarkets4h\":0.007446,\"openInterestChangeSameMarkets24h\":-0.02325,\"openInterestQuantityChange4h\":0.00409,\"openInterestQuantityChange24h\":-0.02824,\"volume24hUsd\":190845,\"fundingRateAnnualized\":2.012,\"fundingStates\":{\"current_indicative\":2},\"page\":\"https://optimistfi.com/perps/markets/nio\"},{\"base\":\"ESPORTS\",\"assetClass\":\"crypto\",\"venues\":6,\"price\":0.007882,\"fundingObservedAt\":\"2026-10-28T23:00:00Z\",\"priceChange24h\":-0.004295,\"openInterestUsd\":2290394,\"openInterestChange4h\":0.003836,\"openInterestChange24h\":-0.01452,\"openInterestChangeSameMarkets4h\":0.003836,\"openInterestChangeSameMarkets24h\":-0.01452,\"openInterestQuantityChange4h\":-0.0004226,\"openInterestQuantityChange24h\":-0.01065,\"quantityBasis\":{\"4h\":\"price_adjusted_notional_oi_proxy\",\"24h\":\"price_adjusted_notional_oi_proxy\"},\"volume24hUsd\":1959439,\"fundingRateAnnualized\":1.92,\"fundingStates\":{\"current_indicative\":5,\"not_stated\":1},\"page\":\"https://optimistfi.com/perps/markets/esports\"}],\"lowest\":[{\"base\":\"AXIS\",\"assetClass\":\"crypto\",\"venues\":9,\"price\":0.1719,\"fundingObservedAt\":\"2026-10-28T23:00:00Z\",\"priceChange24h\":-0.3459,\"openInterestUsd\":5041292,\"openInterestChange4h\":0.1195,\"openInterestChange24h\":-0.2477,\"openInterestChangeSameMarkets4h\":0.1195,\"openInterestChangeSameMarkets24h\":-0.2477,\"openInterestQuantityChange4h\":0.07101,\"openInterestQuantityChange24h\":0.1422,\"volume24hUsd\":47233735,\"fundingRateAnnualized\":-21.56,\"fundingStates\":{\"current_indicative\":8,\"settled\":1},\"page\":\"https://optimistfi.com/perps/markets/axis\"},{\"base\":\"BLUR\",\"assetClass\":\"crypto\",\"venues\":12,\"price\":0.00822,\"fundingObservedAt\":\"2026-10-28T23:00:00Z\",\"priceChange24h\":0.1245,\"openInterestUsd\":10351651,\"openInterestChange4h\":-0.08386,\"openInterestChange24h\":-0.2811,\"openInterestChangeSameMarkets4h\":-0.08386,\"openInterestChangeSameMarkets24h\":-0.2811,\"openInterestQuantityChange4h\":-0.03839,\"openInterestQuantityChange24h\":-0.361,\"quantityBasis\":{\"4h\":\"price_adjusted_notional_oi_proxy\",\"24h\":\"price_adjusted_noti