erestQuantityChange24h\":-0.08253,\"volume24hUsd\":599570,\"fundingRateAnnualized\":-3.248,\"fundingStates\":{\"current_indicative\":3},\"page\":\"https://optimistfi.com/perps/markets/hlt\"}],\"note\":\"This hour's funding, annualized and weighted by each venue's open interest: what a long pays (negative, shorts pay). Hourly readings move: a market's settled funding over 1, 7 and 30 days is fundingCumulative in get_perps. Markets with $1M+ open and $100K+ traded in 24 hours; Jupiter, which charges borrowing rather than funding, is not in the average.\"}}"}],"isError":false}}

